# Chess Coach — optional AI coaching voice.
# Without any of these, the app still works fully: Stockfish + built-in coaching.
# Keys are read ONLY server-side (local Vite dev/preview server, or Vercel
# Functions when hosted) and are never bundled into browser code.

# Option A: Anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5

# Option B: any OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint (OpenAI, OpenRouter, Ollama, LM Studio, ...)
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Force a provider if both are configured: anthropic | openai | none
# COACH_LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic

# REQUIRED when hosted with an LLM key: an access code the app must send, so
# your deployment isn't an open proxy to your API key. Pick a long random
# string, then enter it once in the app under Dashboard → Settings.
# Optional for local development.
# COACH_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Chess.com syncing (optional, no login needed). Requests go through this app's
# small server proxy so they can carry an identifying User-Agent, as Chess.com
# asks of API clients. Put a way to reach you here (an email or URL).
# CHESSCOM_CONTACT=
